abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic companion for the all-prime depth-three Smith profile,
  q-Pascal common-image invariants, Newton-minor controls and bounded
  exceptional certificates associated with the manuscript Depth-Three Smith
  Profiles and Newton-Minor Geometry for Affine Hjelmslev--Radon Incidence.
  The software does not replace the written proof and makes no novelty,
  priority or exhaustive-literature claim.
